  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0 - Breaking Change:\n- Changed BibNumber property from int to string to support alphanumeric bib numbers used in relay events (e.g., \"D120\", \"H210\", \"1853-1\")\n- This change allows proper parsing of relay result XML files from timing systems like MeOS and OE\n- Backward compatible for numeric BibNumbers as they are automatically converted to strings",
